# Shell scripts run on Linux (the campaign VM).  The startup and shutdown
# scripts are uploaded as instance metadata straight from a Windows working
# tree, where core.autocrlf would otherwise give them CRLF endings -- and bash
# stops at the first "\r".
*.sh text eol=lf

# The WP5 campaign data (decision F: committed as-is).  Written on the Linux
# VM with LF endings; this keeps every checkout byte-for-byte identical to the
# VM's file, so a checksum taken here (for a Zenodo deposit, say) matches.
paper/data/sim_*/*.json text eol=lf
paper/data/campaign_log.json text eol=lf
paper/data/campaign_stdout.log text eol=lf
